ent + outreach voice — our messages read as peer-to-peer, not marketing spam. (3) Sales-team-integrated: we work as sales extension not standalone. (4) Compliance-aware: LinkedIn TOS + industry-regulator + your firm compliance. (5) Multi-lever: Sales Nav + InMail + Ads + retargeting + content foundation together. (6) Transparent retainer + no ad-spend markup + 6-month MSA."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How do we start LinkedIn lead-gen with ITD for a Pune manufacturing SME?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Free 30-min discovery call. We audit your current LinkedIn presence + Sales Nav usage + benchmark ICP + share customised 90-day lead-gen plan + tier recommendation + first-30-day outreach + Ads plan within 3 working days. If you proceed: 1-week onboarding (Sales Nav setup + ICP definition + outreach-template writing + CRM integration + content-foundation audit) + first outbound sequences live in week 2 + first Ads live in week 3."}}]}</script>
